        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The basic materials are poured by gravity in a mixer. When filled with 1"500kg the mixing procedure starts and lasts about 15min. To keep it warm it"s filled in a hot basin from where it is put in sausages by a cartridging machine and then packed in card board boxes. A conveyor belt transports the boxes and puts it on paletts for storing\n\n# Included processes\nincludes the whole manufacturing process to produce Tovex (raw material provision, mixing process, packing, internal processes (transport, etc.) and infrastructure.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
